      "end": 42.75,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 42.75,
      "end": 45.61,
      "en": "So the head chef is the main cook.",
      "zh": "所以主厨是主厨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 45.99,
      "end": 47.39,
      "en": "Yes, but he doesn't cook.",
