      "end": 506.98,
      "en": "So basically...",
      "zh": "所以基本上..."
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 506.98,
      "end": 508.16,
      "en": "There's not much wine left.",
      "zh": "剩下的酒不多了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 508.52,
      "end": 509.52,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 509.52,
      "end": 514.76,
      "en": "So if you listen to the examples, you could also be running low on fuel, for example, on your car, etc.",
      "zh": "因此，如果您聆听这些示例，您的燃料也可能不足，例如在您的汽车上等。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 514.76,
      "end": 515.24,
      "en": "Running low on.",
      "zh": "快用完……了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 515.76,
      "end": 518.5,
      "en": "All right, and now let's take a look at our last word.",
      "zh": "好吧，现在让我们来看看我们的最后一个字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 519.32,
      "end": 520.22,
      "en": "Doing really well.",
      "zh": "进展很顺利。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 520.84,
      "end": 521.34,
      "en": "Doing really well.",
      "zh": "进展很顺利。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 522.2,
      "end": 523.63,
      "en": "We are doing really well.",
      "zh": "我们做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 524.12,
      "end": 524.59,
      "en": "Doing really well.",
      "zh": "进展很顺利。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 525.24,
      "end": 528.56,
      "en": "So this seems to be like a pretty simple structure.",
      "zh": "所以这似乎是一个非常简单的结构。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 528.56,
      "end": 531.56,
      "en": "I mean, we know all these words, right?",
      "zh": "我的意思是，我们知道所有这些词，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 531.56,
      "end": 533.0,
      "en": "So why is it special?",
      "zh": "那么为什么它很特别呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 533.0,
      "end": 538.62,
      "en": "Well basically, if you say, I am doing really well, maybe it sounds a little bit difficult to understand.",
      "zh": "好吧，基本上，如果你说，我做得很好，也许听起来有点难以理解。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 539.16,
      "end": 540.88,
      "en": "But what are you doing really well?",
      "zh": "但是你做得很好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 540.88,
      "end": 542.8,
      "en": "So this is a great way of answering a question.",
      "zh": "所以这是回答问题的好方法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 543.04,
      "end": 544.38,
      "en": "When somebody says, how are you?",
      "zh": "当有人说，你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 544.72,
      "end": 545.52,
      "en": "Or how are you doing?",
      "zh": "或者你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 546.12,
      "end": 548.12,
      "en": "You can say, I'm doing really well.",
      "zh": "你可以说，我做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 548.4,
      "end": 549.34,
      "en": "Or I'm doing well.",
      "zh": "或者说“我过得很好”。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 549.76,
      "end": 550.88,
      "en": "In your life, everything is good.",
      "zh": "在你的生活中，一切都是美好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 551.2,
      "end": 553.6,
      "en": "In your life, things are good and you're happy, basically.",
      "zh": "在你的生活中，事情是好的，你很开心，基本上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 554.44,
      "end": 558.0,
      "en": "But in this situation, in the dialogue, what's doing really well?",
      "zh": "但在这种情况下，在对话中，什么是真正好的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 558.14,
      "end": 559.94,
      "en": "Well, the restaurant is doing really well.",
      "zh": "嗯，餐厅做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 560.2,
      "end": 561.84,
      "en": "The business is doing really well.",
      "zh": "生意做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 562.0,
      "end": 565.78,
      "en": "So when he says, we're doing really well, business is good.",
      "zh": "所以当他说，我们做得很好，生意很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 566.42,
      "end": 567.18,
      "en": "They're making lots of money.",
      "zh": "他们赚了很多钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 567.38,
      "end": 567.6,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 568.76,
      "end": 570.4,
      "en": "So you can use it with people.",
      "zh": "所以你可以和人一起使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 570.4,
      "end": 571.76,
      "en": "You can use it with businesses.",
      "zh": "您可以将其与企业一起使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 572.54,
      "end": 575.6,
      "en": "You can say, I'm doing really well in my new job.",
      "zh": "你可以说，我的新工作做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 576.26,
      "end": 578.0,
      "en": "Or my son is doing really well in school.",
      "zh": "或者我儿子在学校做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 578.56,
      "end": 581.32,
      "en": "Okay, so you can use it in those different ways.",
      "zh": "好的，所以你可以用这些不同的方式使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 581.6,
      "end": 601.36,
      "en": "Alright, well, let's listen to the dialogue one last time and we'll be able to hear all of these great words and phrases we just talked about.",
      "zh": "好吧，好吧，让我们最后一次听一听对话，我们将能够听到我们刚刚谈到的所有这些伟大的单词和短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 601.36,
      "end": 629.2,
      "en": "So let's listen to the dialogue one last time.",
      "zh": "所以让我们最后一次听对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 629.2,
      "end": 648.08,
      "en": "So Marco, do you think this chef had a rat under his hat?",
      "zh": "那么马可，你认为这位厨师的帽子下有一只老鼠吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 648.08,
      "end": 653.22,
      "en": "That was a really good movie, Ratatouille, Disney, Pixar, where a rat is a cook.",
      "zh": "那是一部非常好的电影，料理鼠王，迪斯尼，皮克斯，老鼠是厨师。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 654.32,
      "end": 657.36,
      "en": "It's interesting, I love to cook, but I'm not very good at cooking.",
      "zh": "这很有趣，我喜欢做饭，但我不太擅长做饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 658.44,
      "end": 661.6,
      "en": "But it's good because for me, it helps me relieve stress.",
      "zh": "但这很好，因为对我来说，它可以帮助我缓解压力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 662.16,
      "end": 662.8,
      "en": "Me too, actually.",
      "zh": "我也是，其实。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 662.8,
      "end": 669.32,
      "en": "You know, if I'm in a bad mood, I go home and cook something to eat and the world seems a happier place.",
      "zh": "你知道，如果我心情不好，我会回家做饭吃，世界似乎更快乐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 669.32,
      "end": 672.0,
      "en": "And people don't understand it because they think cooking is work.",
      "zh": "人们不理解它，因为他们认为烹饪是工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 672.88,
      "end": 674.77,
      "en": "But for some people, it's fun.",
      "zh": "但对于某些人来说，这很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 675.8,
      "end": 676.55,
      "en": "So what about you guys?",
      "zh": "那么你们呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 676.84,
      "end": 677.75,
      "en": "What do you like to cook?",
      "zh": "你喜欢做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 677.91,
      "end": 680.89,
      "en": "Do you have any particular dish that you prepare very well?",
      "zh": "你有什么特别的菜你准备得很好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 681.27,
      "end": 683.55,
      "en": "And if you do, please send us the recipes.",
      "zh": "如果你这样做了，请把食谱发给我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 684.37,
      "end": 690.65,
      "en": "Exactly, because we know that we have listeners from all over the world and of course, we want to know what type of food you prefer.",
      "zh": "确切地说，因为我们知道我们有来自世界各地的听众，当然，我们想知道您更喜欢哪种食物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 691.77,
      "end": 700.19,
      "en": "So come to EnglishPod.com and post your questions, your comments and your recipes in our community section and Erica and I will always be there.",
      "zh": "因此，请访问 Englishpod.com 并在我们的社区部分发布您的问题、您的评论和食谱，Erica 和我将永远在那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 700.73,
      "end": 704.49,
      "en": "Yes, to test out your recipes as well as answer questions.",
      "zh": "是的，测试您的食谱以及回答问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 704.91,
      "end": 709.63,
      "en": "For sure, if a good recipe comes along, we'll prepare it and we'll let you know how it turned out.",
      "zh": "当然，如果有一个好的食谱出现，我们会准备它，我们会告诉你结果如何。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 710.6,
      "end": 712.96,
      "en": "All right guys, we're out of time, but we'll see you next time.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，我们没有时间了，但我们下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 712.96,
      "end": 713.69,
      "en": "Until then, goodbye.",
      "zh": "在那之前，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 713.96,
      "end": 714.46,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
